@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### List topics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topics

### Search and pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topics?search=HTTP&sort=name&page=1&pageSize=5

### Get one topic
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topics/1

### Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/topics
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Entity Framework Core"}

### Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/topics/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Entity Framework Core 10"}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/topics/1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
